Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.06,0:05:27.72,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}还是算啦
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.86,0:05:39.28,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,スクロール止めちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:39.28,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}スクロール止めちゃう
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.86,0:05:39.28,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,滑动屏幕的手指顿了顿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:39.28,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}滑动屏幕的手指顿了顿
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.28,0:05:43.03,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,声がしたら聞いちゃう
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:43.03,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}声がしたら聞いちゃう
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.28,0:05:43.03,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,只因听见你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:43.03,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}只因听见你的声音
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.99,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,自信がなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.99,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}自信がなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.99,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,即便我没有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.99,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}即便我没有信心
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.99,0:05:46.95,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,嘘が増えても
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:46.95,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}嘘が増えても
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.99,0:05:46.95,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,编织了很多谎言
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:46.95,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}编织了很多谎言
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.62,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,まっすぐな気持ち
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.62,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}まっすぐな気持ち
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.62,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,但对你的真心不变
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.62,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\3a&H20&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\blur2}但对你的真心不变
